  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JISRA- Media Training for Women and Youth across Kaduna &amp; Plateau State on use of Social media.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The JISRA-Media Training for Women and Youth across Kaduna and Plateau States on the effective use of social media for advocacy and online campaigns on Freedom of Religion or Belief (FoRB) promotion, will be a one-day activity focused on MM-Partners, community women, and youth across the JISRA intervention communities in Kaduna and Plateau states. It will equip participants with the necessary digital literacy and advocacy skills to use social media effectively as a tool for promoting FoRB. With the growing role of digital platforms in shaping public discourse, this training is crucial for empowering marginalized voices&#x2014;especially women and youth&#x2014;to engage meaningfully in online advocacy, raise awareness, and influence policy discussions related to religious freedom.</narrative>
  </description>
